{
  "_doc": [
    "Every repeated-experiment output that the R2 manuscript, supplement and response letter depend on, and the pending markers each one fills.",
    "Sources of the markers: npj_R2_WORKING/PENDING_INDEX.md (with PENDING.md, PENDING_supplement.md, PENDING_response.md), edits/content.py, build_response.py (Tables R3, R5, R6) and edits/numbers.py (PENDING keys).",
    "The documents name one key exactly (analysis_repeated/headline.json primary.position_averaged_accuracy, paa_lo, paa_hi); the other keys follow the names of analysis_original/headline.json, which edits/numbers.py already reads, so one reader serves both experiments.",
    "Paths: analysis_repeated/* is relative to the analysis output directory (repeated.OUT by default); figures/* to the figures output directory; tables/* to the tables output directory.",
    "json keys are dotted paths. csv entries list required columns, and for gee.csv the required row labels (first column).",
    "tests/r2/test_repeated_outputs.py runs the whole pipeline on a synthetic world (r2/analysis/synthetic.py) and checks that every key below is produced.",
    "Markers that need a number from outside the repeated-experiment outputs are listed under out_of_scope with their source, for the post-results numbers.py reader."
  ],
  "markers": {
    "R01": {
      "text": "primary outcome sentence: pooled position-averaged accuracy with 95% CI",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Abstract",
        "response AE item 5 (quoted manuscript text)",
        "response R3 comment 8b (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R02": {
      "text": "order-effect and modification-type sentence",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Abstract",
        "response AE item 5 (quoted manuscript text)",
        "response R3 comment 8b (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R03": {
      "text": "served model identifiers and substitutions (substitutions: r2/run/models_v2.json substituted_for)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Methods / Models",
        "response AE item 4 (quoted manuscript text)",
        "response R3 comment 4 (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R04": {
      "text": "dates of the main run (numbers key rep_call_dates)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Methods / Repeated Experiment",
        "supplement 10. Repeated experiment: prompt and requests",
        "response AE item 3 (quoted manuscript text)",
        "response R3 comment 5 (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R05": {
      "text": "primary outcome: pooled position-averaged accuracy with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CI against 50%, evaluations analyzed, non-responses and models without valid responses; the five pre-specified sensitivity analyses (Supplementary Table S8)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Primary Outcome in the Repeated Experiment",
        "response AE item 3 (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R06": {
      "text": "primacy, accuracy with the modified excerpt first and second, GEE OR for modified-first, order-invariant detection, position-driven responding and wrong in both orders, with bootstrap 95% CIs (Figure 2)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Order Effects and Pair-Level Outcomes",
        "response AE item 3 (quoted manuscript text)",
        "response R3 main comment (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R07": {
      "text": "Figure 2 image: (A) primacy, (B) accuracy with the modified excerpt first and second, (C) pair-level outcomes per model; Figure 2 legend with n and the exclusion rule",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Order Effects and Pair-Level Outcomes"
      ]
    },
    "R08": {
      "text": "failure rate by modification type and category with bootstrap 95% CIs and GEE category ORs, reported as associations (Figure 3, Table 1; Supplementary Tables S11 and S12)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Modification Types",
        "response AE item 3 (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R09": {
      "text": "Figure 3 image: failure rate by modification type with 95% CIs and n per type after exclusions; Figure 3 legend with n and the exclusion rule",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Modification Types"
      ]
    },
    "R10": {
      "text": "Table 1 rows from table1_rows() on the repeated experiment: one failure and one success per modification type, from verified, non-excluded pairs, with model and order",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Modification Types"
      ]
    },
    "R11": {
      "text": "Table 1 note: selection rule (one failure and one success per modification type, drawn with a fixed seed from verified, non-excluded pairs) and abbreviations",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Modification Types"
      ]
    },
    "R12": {
      "text": "per-model position-averaged accuracy with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CIs and McNemar content-sensitivity tests with FDR correction (Figure 4; Supplementary Table S13)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Per-Model Results"
      ]
    },
    "R13": {
      "text": "Figure 4 image: per-model position-averaged accuracy with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CIs and order markers; Figure 4 legend with n and the exclusion rule",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Per-Model Results"
      ]
    },
    "R14": {
      "text": "expected calibration error, Brier score and AUROC overall and per model (Supplementary Table S14)",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Confidence"
      ]
    },
    "R15": {
      "text": "exploratory: differences reported by the models, rationale categories, and concordance of per-model position-averaged accuracy between the original experiment (discriminable pairs) and the repeated experiment",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Results / Exploratory Analyses"
      ]
    },
    "R16": {
      "text": "headline synthesis of the repeated experiment in plain terms; one-clause result of the repeated experiment; one-sentence statement of what the repeated experiment shows for the central conclusion",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Discussion (two markers)",
        "response Associate Editor closing",
        "response AE item 5 (quoted manuscript text)",
        "response R3 general (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R17": {
      "text": "interpretation of the order effect in the repeated experiment",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Discussion"
      ]
    },
    "R18": {
      "text": "interpretation of modification-type, per-model and confidence results, as associations, with comparison to prior work",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Discussion"
      ]
    },
    "R19": {
      "text": "result of sensitivity analysis S5",
      "where": [
        "manuscript Discussion",
        "response R3 comment 1 (quoted manuscript text)"
      ]
    },
    "R20": {
      "text": "headline result of the repeated experiment: pooled position-averaged accuracy with 95% CI and the order effect",
      "where": [
        "response Cover letter"
      ]
    },
    "R21": {
      "text": "Table R3, column 'Repeated experiment': repeated-experiment value for each row (pairs analyzed, evaluations, accuracy, position-averaged accuracy, selected position A, accuracy with the modified excerpt first and second, rationales calling the excerpts identical, modification types with at least one pair), with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CI",
      "where": [
        "response Correction section (Table R3)"
      ]
    },
    "R22": {
      "text": "Table R5, column 'Repeated experiment': failure rate by type with 95% CI and n after exclusions",
      "where": [
        "response AE item 3 (Table R5)"
      ]
    },
    "R23": {
      "text": "Table R6, column 'Served identifier': served model identifier and any substitution, per model",
      "where": [
        "response AE item 4 (Table R6)"
      ]
    },
    "S2": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S2: rows per model: requested and served identifiers, provider, reasoning class, decoding, model substituted for, non-responses",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S2"
      ]
    },
    "S7": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S7: per-item agreement and Cohen kappa, pairs excluded by reason and pairs flagged by reason",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S7",
        "manuscript Results / Physician Verification of the Corrected Stimulus Set"
      ]
    },
    "S8": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S8: primary outcome under sensitivity analyses 1 to 5, with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CIs",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S8"
      ]
    },
    "S11": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S11: failure rate by modification type and by category with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CIs",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S11"
      ]
    },
    "S12": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S12: odds ratios with 95% CIs for modified-first and modification category",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S12"
      ]
    },
    "S13": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S13: per-model accuracy in each order with Wilson 95% CIs, position-averaged accuracy with case-cluster bootstrap 95% CIs, pair-level outcomes and McNemar tests with FDR correction",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S13"
      ]
    },
    "S14": {
      "text": "Supplementary Table S14: expected calibration error, Brier score and AUROC overall and per model",
      "where": [
        "supplement Supplementary Table S14"
      ]
    }
  },
